  "contract": [
    "Decode product SN, select model table and publish its pointer, then calibrate; reload configuration after calibration.",
    "Capture model choice once after calibration; get persisted full-word divider; only 1..31 overrides the configuration byte.",
    "Logging modes and configuration halfword are loaded at native sink boundaries.",
    "Send ten register blocks in stock order, lengths and byte contents; all port return statuses are ignored.",
    "Configuration bytes for each block are read at their native transfer boundaries; the captured pointer is retained even if the context pointer later changes.",
    "Table getter uses low-byte decoded-6 index and chooses the live family table after its model-check call."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "The product-SN decoder, slider calibration and persisted word accessor remain real unresolved dependencies and are modeled.",
    "Direct probes execute the actual C configuration/table selector; deeper probes add actual C IQS ports, transport and registry against prepared device callbacks.",
    "IRQ probes also execute actual C recovery, detector, model/count/average/event paths; BSN accessor, error audit and new lower helpers are modeled.",
    "Selector comparisons cover decoded 6..15 and low-byte-equivalent input words. Out-of-range table indices are not claimed safe.",
    "Twenty aligned 30-byte data records match stock ROM, and twenty pointer relocations match the authenticated cold RW mapping. This does not prove final runtime placement or dynamic startup initialization.",
    "An earlier draft used an incorrect table base; stock comparison rejected it. Only the reviewed build/report is current.",
    "A replay diagnostic shows callback PC-redirection falling through under Unicorn after a conditional instruction. The passing harness executes real Thumb BX LR callback returns with an explicit Cortex-M4 CPU; firmware C was unchanged by that harness repair. This is not a physical fault claim.",
    "Global sources-check still fails for the pre-existing unlisted G2 resident_rom_thumb_set.S; R1 passes.",
    "No final application link, physical bus timing or device boot proof; byte identity is not required."
  ],
